###
GET http://localhost:8080/consultas HTTP/1.1

### Cria uma consulta (o id é gerado pelo servidor)
# @name criarConsulta
POST http://localhost:8080/consultas/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "paciente": "Maria Silva",
    "medico": "Dr. João Souza",
    "data": "2026-10-01T14:30:00",
    "criado_em": "2026-09-26T10:00:00"
}

### Busca a consulta criada acima
GET http://localhost:8080/consultas/{{criarConsulta.response.body.$.data.id}} HTTP/1.1

### Atualiza a consulta criada acima
PUT http://localhost:8080/consultas/{{criarConsulta.response.body.$.data.id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "paciente": "Maria Silva",
    "medico": "Dr. João Souza",
    "data": "2026-10-02T09:00:00",
    "criado_em": "2026-09-26T10:00:00"
}

### Remove a consulta criada acima
DELETE http://localhost:8080/consultas/{{criarConsulta.response.body.$.data.id}} HTTP/1.1

### Consulta inexistente (espera 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/consultas/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000 HTTP/1.1

### Campos obrigatórios faltando (espera 422)
POST http://localhost:8080/consultas/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "paciente": "Maria Silva"
}
